  "steps": [
    "Mix the yogurt, curry powder, garam masala, salt and garlic powder in a large bowl. Add the chicken. It can marinate overnight in the fridge.",
    "Melt the butter in a large skillet over medium-low heat. Cook the onion, stirring occasionally, until soft, about 10 minutes.",
    "Raise the heat to medium, add the chicken and its marinade and cook about 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the tomatoes and cream, bring to a boil, then simmer 8–10 minutes until the chicken is cooked through."
